Conduit is a combination of components under different licenses:

- guest/linux: GPL-2.0-only (from virtio-nvgpu driver/)
- host/backend: Apache-2.0 (backend), BSD-3-Clause OR GPL-2.0 (protocol) (from virtio-nvgpu)
- host/viewer: Apache-2.0, see host/viewer/NOTICE (from nvkvm-pv broker)
- host/vmm: Apache-2.0 (from nesbox)
- everything else: Apache-2.0 unless a file says otherwise

Full license texts are in each component directory.
